    <Comment X="-700" Y="-420" Width="640" Height="90" Text="Steampunk WindowLit: a lit window seen from the street -- dark, glossy glass glowing with lamplight through net curtains (UV 0-1 a pane). Glow scales it; past 1 it blooms." />
